<title>GERMANY: German union IG Bau to hold news conference Friday.</title>
<headline>German union IG Bau to hold news conference Friday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction workers' union IG Bau said on Thursday that it planned to hold a news conference at 1200 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>IG Bau said in a statement that it planned to release details of the talks with employers -- due to be held on Friday -- aimed at averting a strike in the construction sector after negotiations over wages and sick-pay broke down last week.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
